 r←Test_Input_Misc_002(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;DT;defMat;month;globalParms;parms;props
⍝ Exercise "Input" with invalid "props" definitions.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#._APLGUI.GUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 7⍴''
 month←⍕¨⍳12
 defMat⍪←'DD' ''month DT.DropDown 0 1 1
 props←1 2 3⍴'DD'(12↑0 0 0 1)

 globalParms←∆GetGlobalParms
 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.posn←50 50
 parms.addToCaption←'No. ',⍕∆GetTestCaseNo
 parms.props←props

 :Trap 11
     n←#._APLGUI.GUI.Input.Create defMat globalParms parms
     →FailsIf 1
 :Else
     →FailsIf'"props" has an invalid rank'≢↑⎕DM
 :EndTrap

 r←∆OK
